2026-11-05T05:35:58+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - When returning lists, match expected ordering (sorted if needed).
2026-11-05T05:35:58+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - When finding pairs (e.g., max product pair), return elements in their original array order, not sorted order.
2026-11-05T05:35:58+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For periodic/floor functions like floor_Min(A, B, N): this computes minimum of floor(A*x/B) for x in [0,N]; the answer is (A//B)*N when considering the floor function minimum, or use (A*N)//B approach carefully. Test with simple cases.
