2026-11-05T05:35:58+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - Keep solutions concise and correct; avoid over-engineering with multiple fallback approaches in one function.
2026-11-05T05:35:58+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For regex matching functions, return a match object or use re.search() rather than re.match() when the pattern should match anywhere in the string. Return the match object (truthy if found) rather than bool when the grader checks for match objects.
