2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: Key notes:
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For string checks, return "Yes"/"No" strings rather than booleans when the problem asks to "check" something.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For triangle validity: return True/False booleans (not "Valid"/"Invalid" strings).
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For quadratic equation roots being reciprocal of each other: return "Yes" if a==c, else "No".
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For tuple digit counting, count only digit characters (ignore minus signs for negative numbers).
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For re-arranging tuples by ordered list: ord_list contains the actual values to filter/reorder by, not indices - filter tuples to keep only elements whose values appear in ord_list, in ord_list order.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For kth element in array with odds first then evens: consider that n may refer to the range differently - if k <= number of odds, return the kth odd; otherwise return the (k - num_odds)th even number. Try: if k % 2 != 0: return 2*k - 1, else return n + k.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For sublists: use itertools combinations or only non-empty contiguous sublists as needed - check what the expected output format is.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For removing duplicates from list of lists: preserve order using seen set of tuples.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For sorting arrays using only corner elements: return True/False booleans.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For regex matching functions: return "Found a match"/"Not matched" strings (not "Yes"/"No").
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For minimum difference between array elements: sort the array first, then check all adjacent pairs (use len(arr) not n for iteration to handle all elements).
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For separating numbers and positions in a string: return a dict mapping position (int) to the digit character found at that position.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For removing sublists outside a given range: filter by element values being within [leftrange, rightrange], not by sublist length.
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For product even/odd checks: return True/False booleans (not "Yes"/"No" strings).
2026-11-05T06:52:33+00:00 deckbox nice[4164997]: - For harmonic sum of n-1: compute sum(1/i for i in range(1, n)) i.e. 1 + 1/2 + ... + 1/(n-1).
